    "final": "The lowest price anyone charges for size M of the Wexcombe tee, among those that can actually be bought, is $11.92 \u2014 charged by 'Wexcombe Midweight Jersey Tee, Short Sleeve - Haldane Apparel' (igr-tcl-40). I opened and checked all 45 tee listings in the search results (36 on page 1, 9 on page 2). On each I examined the size options, selected M where offered, and verified it was buyable (option enabled/in stock with Add to Cart active). 26 listings sold M as buyable; the others either had M disabled (out of stock, 11 listings) or had no M option (8 listings). The best M prices found: $11.92 (Haldane Apparel), $13.02 (Carnforth Textile Company), $14.48 (Dalston Textiles), $16.30 (Dunmore Outfitters). Note several listings looked cheaper on the search results page ('As low as'), but their size-M price was higher or M was not purchasable.",
